---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Kicker from "../components/Kicker.astro";
import Prose from "../components/Prose.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About · Sundharesan Kumaresan">
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px] px-6 pt-16 pb-8">
    <div data-reveal class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-14">
      <div>
        <Kicker text="The long version" />
        <h1 class="mt-3 font-serif font-semibold leading-[0.95]" style="font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);">Sundharesan Kumaresan</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-[42ch] text-lg text-text-muted">An AI engineer and writer working the same question from two sides: <span class="text-text">fairness &amp; legibility: who a system sees, and who it leaves out.</span></p>
      </div>
      <div class="h-[60vw] max-h-[640px] min-h-[360px] w-full bg-cover bg-[center_20%] bg-fixed md:order-first" style="background-image:url('/img/about.jpg')" role="img" aria-label="Portrait of Sundharesan Kumaresan"></div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal class="mt-16"><Prose>
      <p>Placeholder biography. Replace with the real through-line connecting the builder and the writer, with career history folded in as narrative, in your voice.</p>
      <p>A second paragraph: the work at Oogway Labs, the writing across four lenses, the agri-fintech ambition. One story, not three.</p>
    </Prose></div>
    <blockquote data-reveal class="mt-24 max-w-[20ch] border-l-2 border-stellar pl-8 font-serif font-semibold leading-[1.02]" style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6.5vw, 4.5rem);">
      &ldquo;Who a system sees is a moral choice.&rdquo;
    </blockquote>
    <div data-reveal class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm">
      <a href="mailto:sundharesansk11@gmail.com" class="u-underline text-text hover:text-accent">Email</a>
      <a href="#" class="u-underline text-text hover:text-accent">GitHub</a>
      <a href="#" class="u-underline text-text hover:text-accent">LinkedIn</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
